" end="01:02.670">I  </span><span begin="01:02.670" end="01:02.700">I </span><span begin="01:02.700" end="01:03.030">love </span><span begin="01:03.030" end="01:03.180">you </span><span begin="01:03.180" end="01:03.570">like </span><span begin="01:03.570" end="01:03.660">a </span><span begin="01:03.660" end="01:04.140">love </span><span begin="01:04.140" end="01:04.740">song  </span><span begin="01:04.740" end="01:05.910">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.060" end="01:09.450"><span begin="01:06.060" end="01:06.390">And </span><span begin="01:06.390" end="01:06.540">I </span><span begin="01:06.540" end="01:06.900">keep </span><span begin="01:06.900" end="01:07.170">it </span><span begin="01:07.170" end="01:07.350">in </span><span begin="01:07.350" end="01:07.830">re</span><span begin="01:07.830" end="01:08.100">-</span><span begin="01:08.100" end="01:08.340">pe</span><span begin="01:08.340" end="01:08.370">-</span><span begin="01:08.370" end="01:08.610">pe</span><span begin="01:08.610" end="01:08.880">-</span><span begin="01:08.880" end="01:09.450">peat</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.540" end="01:12.210"><span begin="01:09.540" end="01:11.130">Constantly </span><span begin="01:11.130" end="01:11.460">boy </span><span begin="01:11.460" end="01:11.640">you </span><span begin="01:11.640" end="01:12.210">played</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.210" end="01:14.970"><span begin="01:12.210" end="01:12.390">through </span><span begin="01:12.390" end="01:12.630">my </span><span begin="01:12.630" end="01:13.260">mind </span><span begin="01:13.260" end="01:13.590">like </span><span begin="01:13.590" end="01:13.650">a </span><span begin="01:13.650" end="01:14.970">symphony</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.240" end="01:19.050"><span begin="01:15.240" end="01:15.570">There's </span><span begin="01:15.570" end="01:15.810">no </span><span begin="01:15.810" end="01:16.350">way </span><span begin="01:16.350" end="01:16.590">to </span><span begin="